sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor E as Empresa
    actor C as Coordenação
    participant GW as api-gateway
    participant AS as application-service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant DS as document-service
    participant NS as notification-service

    E->>GW: POST /api/applications/{id}/approve (termos + seguro)
    GW->>AS: valida JWT/papel e encaminha
    AS->>AS: regras da Lei 11.788 (jornada, 2 anos/PcD, seguro)
    AS-->>E: 200 status=approved
    AS->>MQ: application.status_changed (approved, termos)
    MQ->>DS: entrega (idempotente por event_id)
    DS->>DS: gera TCE em PDF (exige seguro)
    DS->>MQ: agreement.generated
    MQ->>AS: entrega
    AS->>AS: approved → agreement_pending
    AS->>MQ: application.status_changed (agreement_pending)
    MQ->>NS: notifica estudante, empresa e coordenação
    C->>GW: POST /api/agreements/{id}/approve
    GW->>DS: encaminha (papel coordinator)
    DS->>MQ: agreement.approved
    MQ->>AS: entrega
    AS->>AS: agreement_pending → active (próximo relatório em 6 meses)
    AS->>MQ: application.status_changed (active)
    MQ->>NS: "TCE aprovado — estágio ativo!"
